{"id":"n31763-1-9","stage":3,"title":"정장 · 正装","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31763-1-9-1","ko":"아드님이 다음 주부터 회사에 출근하지요?","zh":"您儿子从下周开始要去公司上班吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아드님이","meaning":"贵公子，令郎","explanation":"아드님：贵公子，令郎；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아드님","audio":"/audio/cbb702570cf6e24df5b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24482","senseId":"1","lemma":"아드님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아드님이","audio":"/audio/1fd3cb924adae4e50eac.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"下面，下一个","explanation":"다음：下面，下一个。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"2","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"주부터","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주부터","audio":"/audio/2beadcb0ad7b5ddd139b.mp3"}},{"text":"회사에","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사에","audio":"/audio/b40802e07b0e88855c61.mp3"}},{"text":"출근하지요?","meaning":"上班","explanation":"출근하다：上班；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"출근하다","audio":"/audio/c9a21c441e737abe8903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62368","senseId":"1","lemma":"출근하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"출근하지요","audio":"/audio/8feb3f4cc775a98830e9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"cbb702570cf6e24d","term":"아드님","zh":"贵公子，令郎","audio":"/audio/cbb702570cf6e24df5b2.mp3","entryId":"24482","definition":"(敬语)他人的儿子。","pronunciation":["아드님"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"下面，下一个","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"这个次序的后一个。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"c9a21c441e737abe","term":"출근하다","zh":"上班","audio":"/audio/c9a21c441e737abe8903.mp3","entryId":"62368","definition":"去单位工作。","pronunciation":["출근하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5e856939058b46776d6c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31763-1-9-2","ko":"네, 그래서 정장을 한 벌 사려고요.","zh":"是的，所以我想买一套正装。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以。","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}},{"text":"정장을","meaning":"正装","explanation":"정장：正装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"정장","audio":"/audio/e22229bb260aee036fe0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31763","senseId":"1","lemma":"정장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정장을","audio":"/audio/8280717efcdf0ab3e268.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个，同一","explanation":"한：一个，同一。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"4","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading"